To change the length of the graphic and the anchor points of the Buffer, click Show Manipulators 
  on
the Edit ribbon tab or press M on the keyboard.
The Buffer is ideally suited for modeling a buffer with a great Capacity requiring high performance. If you
need more advanced functions, you can use the PlaceBuffer 
 .
We offer alternative graphics for the Buffer. Click Exchange Graphics in the window of the Buffer and
select an alternative graphic.
Plant Simulation shows the MUs in the Buffer stacked.
Add the Object to the Simulation Model
To add the object Buffer to your simulation model, click 
  Manage Class Library > Basic Objects >
MaterialFlow > Buffer on the Home ribbon tab.
